[{"client_msg_id":"52100a5b-ef6b-4a53-accb-2491e873d223","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"コンテナ54%","ts":"1632183544.138700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mM2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84a4cb51-7376-4fcc-92c3-d77bd347436b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"7836本。","ts":"1632183533.138400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"38e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"130d884c-4f94-4419-91ab-14436f06f4d2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あ、よくみたら653本ではなく653 casesか. 雑にぐぐったところ、1 case = 12 bottlesらしいです","ts":"1632183525.138200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kzk","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/vScN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2C1EAC78-4612-41C7-A76F-3C891BD70D09","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"デイリーワインだとコンテナを年に2〜3回転くらいはさせるのと、これを世界中の様々なインポーターに輸出するということになるので、絶対的な比率はもっと少なくなりそうですね。","ts":"1632183382.137200","edited":{"user":"U843L486L","ts":"1632183518.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"otqf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13306d8c-e788-40ac-8ada-8e838f726477","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"653/14400 = 4.5% もっと少なかったw","ts":"1632183209.133000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M1OY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5211fd05-0fa1-4da8-9331-c6b9fb37f0e9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おおーなるほど。仮にすべてを日本に輸出してもコンテナ1個の7%しか埋まらないレベル","ts":"1632183135.132700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OqnyT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97d14c3a-b14a-4cde-a5fc-4225160aacb7","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":wakarite: \u0026gt; ボードゲーム","ts":"1632183068.132100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NyikY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7024E5B0-64E0-451A-91AA-4F06B3C519A5","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"ちなみに日本に輸入するとなると、通常1コンテナ単位で入ってきて、20フィートのリーファーコンテナを使用した場合、7500～9600本、40フィートコンテナの場合、14400本の積載が可能ということなので、odyssayの1000本くらいの生産量って雀の涙ですね。通常シリーズを取り扱っているインポーターへの割り当て数も少なそう。","ts":"1632183036.131700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1vdN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F873C945-C8C2-4A41-BB06-D44C14F30A35","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"あー。それはボードゲームでも同じで、それを突っ込んだ覚えがあります。生産者視点とゲームバランスの問題だという話に帰着しました。","ts":"1632182937.129600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VfbQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"035e6a2d-8b3d-4941-9289-a9ee62ab6cab","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみに前述のゲームHundred Daysでは、瓶熟成がなくて (基本的にbottlingしてからは味は変化しない), 樽熟成もするかしないかまたするならどのくらいの期間かみたいなのを選ぶ感じでした","ts":"1632182807.127300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k1p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8463a249-6b0c-4cef-8a0b-addd71dbf906","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"別のやつだけどたとえばchardonnayだと10月にpickingするみたいですね \u003chttp://www.graymonk.com/our-wines/estate-wines/estate-white/chardonnay-unwooded/\u003e そこから発酵 \u0026amp; 樽。malolactic fermentationはスキップ。","ts":"1632182743.125800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KLZq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AD481933-9A56-4221-A9D4-598DA134D7E7","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"どうでしょう。樽熟成と瓶熟成の両方のパタンがあります。","ts":"1632182734.125500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zLCGj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fc2a36c-85f2-4662-9c7b-3deef97e24a0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"どのくらい樽で寝かせてるかによるって感じですね","ts":"1632182650.123500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/7iv4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b1771a6-5e36-4890-a878-7236b5cbd530","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":goodpoem: 夢が広がる...","ts":"1632182639.122900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4hjL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FC49B301-B730-450B-9C1D-0C03558DE31A","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"次期を狙いたいところですね。酒屋で買った画像を見る限りだと2020ヴィンテージでしたので、そのうちリリースされるのかな。全部売り切らずに現地で細々と取り扱っていることもありますし、楽しみが増えましたね。","ts":"1632182540.120600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j2bC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9927216-6ac0-47c8-a9db-f0f2d5caeaae","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね (少なくともリンクされてた2019年のはもう入手できなさそう)","ts":"1632182283.115900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xZqWy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9431C20A-B371-497C-98F2-901FE2FC2296","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"odyssayは653ケースしか生産していないんですね。希少だ。","ts":"1632182259.115400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WDcui"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f3a795f-e2b0-4fed-82c4-97e839382741","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"直接通販、送料めちゃくちゃ高いイメージがあったけど、$75以上まとめ買いで無料になるらしいので、現実的に可能そうです。ワイン4本くらい","ts":"1632182186.114200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=5Oe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"865f4273-45e4-4ddf-a1cc-301c99f1f934","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":u6709:","ts":"1632182145.113500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cAXX"}]}