れのであれば、いい生産者なんですね。きっと。\n\nこうやって美味しいと感じた生産者ってどの品種でもおいしく作っているはずので、ぜひ「Pinot Gris」と「Riesling」も試して欲しいです。\n\n特にピノ・グリを！","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-gourmet","ts":1629510579.184600,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CCLJFJ58F/p1629510579184600","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CCLJFJ58F/p1629510579184600"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sIxrw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2568b79e-54d3-49e2-b2be-b4ca6c71291e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"今更知ったんですが、gray monkってそのまんまpinot grisの直訳だったんですね","ts":"1632175216.096500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T7X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28a1c3e2-d6dd-40a1-8799-5695d2b11f26","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"目玉と頬肉好き","ts":"1632153444.095600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakarite","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rDgJm"}]}]
